speechtext:
The Minister of Trade and
Commerce will continue to make his statements, but everyone here knows that the North Stars have been operating for some time. What I want to point out is this. We were told that there had been a serious drop, and I just ask you, Mr. Chairman, to see where the drop was:	April last year 53,322;
May, 58,461; June, 64,458; July, 66,051; August, 66,659.
